    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Thomas Byrne Auctioneers are delighted to introduce to the market this fantastic own door duplex residence, located in the heart of the town of Drogheda.\r\n\r\nThis outstanding property with a delightful aspect comprises: Entrance Hall, large open plan Sitting Room / Dining Room, Kitchen, 3 excellent Bedrooms (Main En-suite), superb Bathroom with shower. Beautiful southwest facing patio. PVC double glazed windows, natural gas central heating.\r\n\r\nSienna is a unique location and an oasis in the centre of town. This is one of the nicest homes to come on the market in Sienna this year and viewing is therefore very highly recommended.\r\n\r\nViewing highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hal Semi solid oak floor.\r\n\r\nSitting Room/ Attractive fireplace, TV point & semi solid oak timber floor.\r\nDining Room\r\n\r\nKitchen New fully fitted kitchen with high gloss tiled floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 Beautiful built in wardrobes semi solid oak floor & TV point. En Suite tiled throughout.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 Slide robe wardrobe & carpet floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 Slide robe wardrobe & carpet floor.\r\n\r\nBathroom Tiled throughout."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "• New front door\r\n• Newly installed condensing boiler\r\n• 2 x parking permits\r\n• New French patio doors to balcony\r\n• Alarmed\r\n\r\nBalcony to rear with a south westerly aspect"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C"
      }
    ],
